) Day","tr":"yawma","l":"يَوْم","r":"يوم","p":"temps","a":"wbw/079_006_001.mp3"},{"t":"تَرْجُفُ","en":"will quake","tr":"tarjufu","l":"تَرْجُفُ","r":"رجف","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/079_006_002.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلرَّاجِفَةُ","en":"the quaking one","tr":"l-rājifatu","l":"راجِفَة","r":"رجف","p":"nom","a":"wbw/079_006_003.mp3"}]},{"n":7,"k":"79:7","fr":"immédiatement suivi du deuxième.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/079007.mp3","w":[{"t":"تَتْبَعُهَا","en":"Follows it","tr":"tatbaʿuhā","l":"تَبِعَ","r":"تبع","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/079_007_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱلرَّادِفَةُ","en":"the subsequent","tr":"l-rādifatu","l":"رادِفَة","r":"ردف","p":"nom","a":"wbw/079_007_002.mp3"}]},{"n":8,"k":"79:8","fr":"Ce jour-là, il y aura des cœurs qui seront agités d’effroi,","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/079008.mp3","w":[{"t":"قُلُوبٌۭ","en":"Hearts","tr":"qulūbun","l":"قَلْب","r":"قلب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/079_008_001.mp3"},{"t":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en":"that Day","tr":"yawma-idhin","l":"يَوْم","r":"يوم","p":"temps","a":"wbw/079_008_002.mp3"},{"t":"وَاجِفَةٌ","en":"will palpitate","tr":"wājifatun","l":"واجِفَة","r":"وجف","p":"adjectif","a":"wbw/079_008_003.mp3"}]},{"n":9,"k":"79:9","fr":"et leurs regards se baisseront.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/079009.mp3","w":[{"t":"أَبْصَـٰرُهَا","en":"Their eyes","tr":"abṣāruhā","l":"بَصَر","r":"بصر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/079_009_001.mp3"},{"t":"خَـٰشِعَةٌۭ","en":"humbled","tr":"khāshiʿatun","l":"خاشِع","r":"خشع","p":"nom","a":"wbw/079_009_002.mp3"}]},{"n":10,"k":"79:10","fr":"Ils disent : \"Quoi ! Serons-nous ramenés à notre vie première,","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/079010.mp3","w":[{"t":"يَقُولُونَ","en":"They say","tr":"yaqūlūna","l":"قالَ","r":"قول","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/079_010_001.mp3"},{"t":"أَءِنَّا","en":"Will we","tr":"a-innā","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/079_010_002.mp3"},{"t":"لَمَرْدُودُونَ","en":"indeed be returned","tr":"lamardūdūna","l":"مَرْدُود","r":"ردد","p":"nom","a":"wbw/079_010_003.mp3"},{"t":"فِى","en":"to","tr":"fī","l":"فِي","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/079_0